{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> By logical reasoning it would appear that the stretching out of his hand was with the staff, yet afterward it is written, \"And Moses stretched out his staff toward the heavens\" — that is, the air, like על פני רקיע השמים (Genesis 1)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:32:58.397317833Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}